From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tanjilbhuiyan <tanjilbhuiyan@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:40:31 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 43/63] fbdev: add A50 DECON handover with stock metadata and
 padded DMA scanout

Consolidate the M7.2 and G2b-G2g tested display path. Keep optional register snapshots behind a default-off diagnostic config; retain passive counters for regression observation. Scope remains single-window normal linear buffers on bootloader-configured hardware. Add an explicit driver config and display DT profile.

Change-Id: I53ebdbee46560a1af53bddaf71715b60d22a5e94
---
